  <section>
    <h2>Behaviour in Amstelvar Avar2</h2>
    <p>
      Amstelvar Avar2 implements YSVA through separate axes for uppercase,
      lowercase, and figures. The transformation changes the vertical extent
      of vertical serifs while preserving their attachment, proportion, and
      relationship to the vertical construction they complete.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Straight construction — T</h2>
    <p>
      T is a useful control: the vertical serif becomes shallower or deeper
      while its position on the vertical stem remains stable.
    </p>

